    <string name="privacy_policy_text">This application (DaisyBook Reader) handles user information according to the following policy.\n\n1. Information collected\nIn principle, this application does not collect personal information.\nOnly when you use the \u201cSend log\u201d feature, device information (model, OS version), app version, and error logs are sent to the developer\u0027s email address for troubleshooting.\n\n2. Handling of credentials\nSapie Library and ChattyLib IDs and passwords are stored only on the device in encrypted form and are never sent externally.\n\n3. Third-party provision\nCollected information is not provided to third parties.\n\n4. Contact\nFor inquiries regarding this policy, please contact naofum@gmail.com.</string>
